1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:02,321
(Leonard:)Is that a pregnancy test?

2
00:00:02,477 --> 00:00:05,017
(Penny:)Just the first one.
I didn't save them all.

3
00:00:10,852 --> 00:00:13,892
(Leonard:)I can't believe
I read this table wrong.

4
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,465
(Sheldon:)I blame you.

5
00:00:17,558 --> 00:00:18,898
(Amy:)Me? What did I do?

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,470
(Sheldon:)You distract me.

7
00:00:20,628 --> 00:00:23,038
(Sheldon:)I've been distracted
since the moment I met you.

8
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,473
(Howard:)-Sorry.
-Well, you should be.

9
00:00:27,635 --> 00:00:31,135
(Sheldon:)Because all I can think about
is how much I want to kiss you.

10
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:36,552
(Sheldon:)And not just on the cheek,
but on the mouth.

11
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:42,358
(Sheldon:)Like mommies and daddies do.

12
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,720
(Amy:)Oh, Sheldon.

13
00:00:52,894 --> 00:00:54,164
(Sheldon(not in Amy's daydream, now in the Cheesecake Factory):)Amy?

14
00:00:56,831 --> 00:01:00,041
(Sheldon(not in Amy's daydream, now in the Cheesecake Factory):)Amy? Did you hear what I said?

15
00:01:00,201 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)Can't talk, in the zone.

